  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Albertus de Berardenga dat Ildebrandino de Cacciacontis partem hereditatis paternae sitam in contrata Sancti Martini cum domibus et terris, et accipit in permutatione partem hereditatis in loco qui dicitur Castelvecchio cum iure patronatus ecclesiae, utraque parte consentiente et laudante.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis ex partibus hanc permutationem rescindere temptaverit, poenam dupli valoris rerum permutatarum persolvat et carta ista in suo robore permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Salimbene de Ugurgieri</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Guidottus filius Rainerii</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Ubertinus de Forteguerri</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
